    d("21:90:12","Restore the good-deed relation and a coherent past habitual predicate.")
    p("21:108","submission-question",[("öyleyse ",9),("teslim olanlar",11),(" mı",9),("sınız?",10)],"Fa-hal antum muslimuna is the consequence question about submission. Expose fa/hal as consequence/question, antum as personal predicate ending and muslimun as submitters; remove the three duplicated questions/siz copies.")
    d("21:108:11","Restore a single coherent question with each source contribution visible, without inserting an additional doctrinal criterion.")
    d("22:5:52 22:5:53 22:5:54 22:5:66","Retain the explicitly inspected constructions: bilgi sahibi olduktan sonra correctly distributes anterior case, after and knowledge content; min kulli zawjin identifies the kinds/pairs grown, expressed by the supplied her çifti quantifier frame. This does not assert a scientific botany interpretation of zawj.",True)
    p("22:23","bracelet-adornment",[("bilezikler",16),("le",15)],"Min asawira identifies the bracelets used in adornment. Turkish süslenmek uses the instrumental -le; expose that contextual relation instead of forcing a spatial source case.")
